      "value": "@{62a0f41fbd141b1ddb15523d|full_name} With this clue I can 100% confirm that this is caused by the parent constraints being auto-converted to VRC Constraints at runtime. Removing the parent constraints resolves the issue. No Idea why that would make the body disappear, but it does.",
