      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've narrowed it down to the combination of parent constraint (Katana.r and Katana.l) and animation that scales the parent of that object to zero (katanas-base.anim). For some reason the combination of those two things makes the body disappear. Changing the animation scale value to anything other than exactly zero or removing the parent constraints fixes the issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
